      <title>客服Agent评估从黄金指标转向Rubric后实现可追溯迭代</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260902/%E5%AE%A2%E6%9C%8DAgent%E8%AF%84%E4%BC%B0%E4%BB%8E%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E6%8C%87%E6%A0%87%E8%BD%AC%E5%90%91Rubric%E5%90%8E%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%BD%E6%BA%AF%E8%BF%AD%E4%BB%A3/</link>
